[ARRAYS]

- object which contains elements of a similar data type
- stored in a contiguous memory location
- data structure where we store similar elements
- fixed set of elements

--- SINGLE DIMENSIONAL ARRAY ---
- linear
- can be declared with elements
    ** String[] cars = {"Sedan", "SUV", "Pickup"}; **
- with size only
    ** int[] evenNumbers = new int[5];
- can assign new numbers for each index;
    ** evenNumbers[0] = 2; ...evenNumbers[4] =10; **

*** ADVANTAGE ***
- Code Optimization
- Storage Location / Manipulation

*** DISADVANTAGE ***
- Size Limit -> to solve, collection framework is being used
